      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR MARTINI (9) just felt the pinch late when leading over 1000m at Belmont first-up, nabbed by a handy one close to home. She'll be better for that effort and things looks to work out nicely for her today. Can find the front and will take beating with no weight on her back. OFFICIAL BUSINESS (6) took on some strong 2YO races last campaign and wasn't far off the mark. His two trials coming back in this time have been super and Chris Parnham's booking is a good push for his chances. Can sit just off the speed and land the knockout blow. KUTE AS KAN BE (8) may not have run out the 1200m journey last start at Belmont and coming back to this track and trip could hold the key. She'll be handy from the inside barrier and she can make her presence felt. SALVE REGINA (3) is better than she showed last time out and can get back to his best. GUNNING FOR GOLD (7) can feature on the back of some handy trials coming in.",
